1
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,000
It hurts, doesn't it?

2
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,151
You'll feel better tomorrow, Betty, believe me.

3
00:00:40,151 --> 00:00:43,900
Only one day, and it won't hurt as much.

4
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,400
Do you feel like eating?

5
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,400
Having some dinner?

6
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,756
Oh, don't look so sad.

7
00:00:49,756 --> 00:00:51,700
Let me tell you about your dinner.

8
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:52,800
It's ice cream.

9
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:53,800
Ice cream.

10
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,502
All kinds of flavors.

11
00:00:55,502 --> 00:00:57,788
Chocolate.

12
00:00:57,788 --> 00:00:59,208
Strawberry?

13
00:00:59,208 --> 00:01:00,168
Vanilla?

14
00:01:00,168 --> 00:01:01,927
Vanilla, too?

15
00:01:01,927 --> 00:01:03,500
I see you're feeling better already, Betty.

16
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:05,421
So you will have dinner?

17
00:01:05,421 --> 00:01:07,223
OK, honey, we'll see to it

18
00:01:07,223 --> 00:01:10,800
that you have strawberry and vanilla ice cream.

19
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:11,745
Just rest now.

20
00:01:11,745 --> 00:01:18,400
You need some rest to help you get better quickly.

21
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:21,393
Hi, Frank.

22
00:01:21,393 --> 00:01:24,500
How you doing?

23
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:25,000
Oh, come on now.

24
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:25,900
You're a big boy.

25
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:29,100
It doesn't hurt that much, does it?

26
00:01:29,100 --> 00:01:31,814
Oh, I'm sorry it hurts so much,

27
00:01:31,814 --> 00:01:33,300
and you won't be able to have dinner.

28
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:36,489
You're just going to have to have ice cream.

29
00:01:36,489 --> 00:01:38,614
Yes, ice cream.

30
00:01:38,614 --> 00:01:39,821
Lots of flavors.

31
00:01:39,821 --> 00:01:41,223
Want to hear them?

32
00:01:41,223 --> 00:01:43,051
Chocolate?

33
00:01:43,051 --> 00:01:44,500
Then chocolate it is.

34
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:45,700
One scoop or two?

35
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:47,000
Three scoops?

36
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:55,900
Then three it will be.

37
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:57,000
You want three scoops also?

38
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,643
Chocolate, too?

39
00:01:59,643 --> 00:02:01,955
Well, I see you're feeling better.

40
00:02:01,955 --> 00:02:05,406
Well, at least you're acting like you feel better.

41
00:02:05,406 --> 00:02:14,600
Three scoops of chocolate ice cream for Tim coming up.

42
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:16,158
Hi, Carl.

43
00:02:16,158 --> 00:02:19,431
How you doing?

44
00:02:19,431 --> 00:02:21,249
I know it hurts.

45
00:02:21,249 --> 00:02:23,162
But it'll be better tomorrow.

46
00:02:23,162 --> 00:02:25,100
In the meantime, what would you like?

47
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:27,300
Surprise.

48
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:29,325
A surprise?

49
00:02:29,325 --> 00:02:31,200
I promised you a surprise, didn't I?

50
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:34,663
And it wasn't just ice cream, was it?

51
00:02:34,663 --> 00:02:36,800
Your birthday is tomorrow, isn't it?

52
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:39,600
Well, maybe, just maybe,

53
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,100
there will be a surprise.

54
00:02:41,100 --> 00:02:43,800
But first you have to smile.

55
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:48,200
I just want to see one smile from you.

56
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:53,000
No smile, no surprise.

57
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,100
That's the deal.

58
00:02:54,100 --> 00:02:56,000
No smile, no surprise.

59
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:56,800
If you want a surprise,

60
00:02:56,800 --> 00:03:14,800
then you've got to smile first.

61
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,800
How you all doing ?

62
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,429
Well, I'm glad you're feeling better

63
00:03:18,429 --> 00:03:20,300
because we have a little surprise for you today.

64
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:21,500
It's Carl's birthday,

65
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:24,800
and we have Popo the Clown to entertain you.

66
00:03:24,800 --> 00:04:39,800
And here he is--Popo the Clown.

67
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,542
Happy birthday, Carl.

68
00:04:41,542 --> 00:04:42,700
Happy birthday.

69
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:44,400
All right, everybody.

70
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,000
OK, Carl.

71
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,000
It's your birthday.

72
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,100
What 's your wish?

73
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:48,300
What would you like?

74
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:50,424
Hmm?

75
00:04:50,424 --> 00:04:53,424
You want to play charades?
